error: `u32::wrapping_add` wraps on overflow
 --> tools/dylint/examples/wrapping_arithmetic.rs:6:45
  |
6 | const fn stepped(value: u32) -> u32 { value.wrapping_add(1) }
  |                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: call `checked_add` and return its `None` as an error, or `saturating_add` to clamp at the `u32` bounds
  = note: `#[deny(wrapping_arithmetic)]` on by default

